      {
        "kind": "text",
        "heading": "Vector-valued functions",
        "body": {
          "en": "A path in space is \\( \\mathbf{r}(t)=\\langle x(t),y(t),z(t)\\rangle \\). Differentiating component-by-component gives the <strong>velocity</strong> \\( \\mathbf{r}'(t) \\), whose length \\( |\\mathbf{r}'(t)| \\) is the <strong>speed</strong>; differentiating again gives acceleration.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Dot product",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\mathbf{v}=u_1v_1+u_2v_2+u_3v_3 \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Unit vector",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\hat{\\mathbf{v}}=\\mathbf{v}/|\\mathbf{v}| \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Angle",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\cos\\theta=\\dfrac{\\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\mathbf{v}}{|\\mathbf{u}|\\,|\\mathbf{v}|} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Velocity",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\mathbf{r}'(t)=\\langle x',y',z'\\rangle \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 12.A — Angle between vectors",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find the angle between \\( \\mathbf{u}=\\langle 1,2,2\\rangle \\) and \\( \\mathbf{v}=\\langle 2,0,1\\rangle \\).</p><p>Here \\( \\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\mathbf{v}=2+0+2=4 \\), \\( |\\mathbf{u}|=3 \\), \\( |\\mathbf{v}|=\\sqrt5 \\), so</p>\\[ \\cos\\theta=\\frac{4}{3\\sqrt5}\\approx 0.596 \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad \\theta\\approx 53.4^{\\circ}. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 12.B — Velocity and speed",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>For the helix \\( \\mathbf{r}(t)=\\langle\\cos t,\\sin t,t\\rangle \\), find the velocity and speed.</p><p>Differentiating each component, \\( \\mathbf{r}'(t)=\\langle-\\sin t,\\cos t,1\\rangle \\). Its length is constant:</p>\\[ |\\mathbf{r}'(t)|=\\sqrt{\\sin^{2}t+\\cos^{2}t+1}=\\sqrt2. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  },
